{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01683","headline":"杂曲歌辞 少年行三首 二 · 李嶷","name":"杂曲歌辞 少年行三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侍猎长杨下，承恩更射飞。\n尘生马影灭，箭落鴈行稀。\n薄暮归随仗，联翩入琐闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嶷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}